  "scope": "All-degree classification excludes every globally submersive fixed-W2 first function with a polynomial logarithmic repair witness of original t-degree at most one. For the ENTIRE polynomial-mutation family q>=2, even the GEOMETRIC generic original affine curve reconstructs Q up to constant affine substitution: a valuation/quadruple-count argument handles q>=3 and a separate exhaustive quintic-pencil argument handles q=2. Two actual degree15 global submersions have isomorphic FULL POINTED AMBIENT TORSION, matching support/component counts, rational-pair degree and puncture count, but geometrically nonisomorphic generic curves. The complete1085-clock zero-budget LRC census removes729 clocks in three separate stages, leaving6889/max11934 and a356-element zero-budget slice/max7056, only in the inherited connected-complement scope. Exact cell and line separator states and arbitrary capacity-two degree-cost matching gadgets localize original-grid repair to ordinary incidence blocks; a geometric family has exponential improvement over the old merged-bag branching. General conjectures remain OPEN; no external priority claim.",
